<title>FINLAND: ASKO 96 PRETAX PROFIT RISES TO FIM 355 MLN.</title>
<headline>ASKO 96 PRETAX PROFIT RISES TO FIM 355 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish plastic pipe and furniture maker Asko Oy said on Wednesday its 1996 pre-tax profit was 355 million markka, up 78 million on 1995, and its 1996 net sales were 7.4 billion markka, up from 7.1 billion.</p>
<p>&quot;Earnings in the latter half of the year were clearly better than in the first half,&quot; Asko said in a statement announcing preliminary results.  </p>
<p>Asko said all of its business divisions made profits.</p>
<p>Asko's full financial statement is due for release on February 25, 1997.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-6805 0245</p>
